/****************************************************************************
 * Name: rk3576_clk_register_gmac
 *
 * Description:
 *   Register the SDGMAC/GMAC clock domain: the two Ethernet MACs
 *   (GMAC0/GMAC1) and the bus/GRF clocks they share with the SDIO and
 *   SDMMC0 controllers.
 *
 *   The SDGMAC domain has three bus roots and one register-file clock,
 *   all gated from CRU_GATE_CON42 (0x08a8):
 *
 *     aclk_sdgmac_root  CLKSEL_CON103[7]     + div[6:2] + GATE_CON42[1]
 *     pclk_sdgmac_root  CLKSEL_CON103[9:8]              + GATE_CON42[2]
 *     hclk_sdgmac_root  CLKSEL_CON103[1:0]              + GATE_CON42[0]
 *     pclk_sdgmac_grf                                   + GATE_CON42[3]
 *
 *   and each GMAC hangs off the AXI/APB root:
 *
 *     aclk_gmac0/1  GATE_CON42[7]/[8], parent aclk_sdgmac_root
 *     pclk_gmac0/1  GATE_CON42[9]/[10], parent pclk_sdgmac_root
 *
 *   The 125 MHz MAC line clock (RGMII) is divider-only — there is no
 *   parent mux, the source is CPLL:
 *
 *     clk_gmac0_125m_src  CLKSEL_CON30[14:10] + GATE_CON03[6]
 *     clk_gmac1_125m_src  CLKSEL_CON31[4:0]   + GATE_CON03[7]
 *
 *   The PTP reference clocks are also part of the domain; note that
 *   clk_gmac0_ptp_ref_src is the one GMAC clock gated from GATE_CON43
 *   (bit 0), not GATE_CON42:
 *
 *     clk_gmac0_ptp_ref_src  CLKSEL_CON105[6:5] + div[4:0] + GATE_CON43[0]
 *     clk_gmac1_ptp_ref_src  CLKSEL_CON104[14:13]+div[12:8]+ GATE_CON42[15]
 *     clk_gmac0/1_ptp_ref                              + GATE_CON42[14]/[13]
 *
 *   hclk_sdgmac_root is registered in rk3576_clk_register_ahb();
 *   cclk_src_sdio/hclk_sdio and cclk_src_sdmmc0/hclk_sdmmc0 hang off
 *   these roots and are registered in rk3576_clk_register_sdio() and
 *   rk3576_clk_register_sdmmc0().
 *
 *   Not modelled: the RMII CRU clocks (CLK_GMAC0/1_RMII_CRU, GATE_CON05)
 *   and the 25 MHz refclko25m_gmac0/1_out (CLKSEL_CON36 + GATE_CON05).
 *   The KICKPI-K7 uses RGMII and its PHYs have their own 25 MHz crystals.
 ****************************************************************************/

